* Simple NMOS test with BSIM4 reference C++ device
.MODEL NMOS_TEST NMOS2 (LEVEL=2 VTH0=0.4 KP=100e-6 U0=0.05 VSAT=8e4 TOX=5e-9 GAMMA=0.0 PHI=0.6 TNOM=300.15 TEMP=300.15)

* Common-source: VDD=3V, Rload=1k from rail to drain, gate swept
V1 RAIL 0 DC 3.0
V2 GATE 0 DC 2.0
R1 RAIL DRAIN 1e3
RG DRAIN 0 1e6

M1 DRAIN GATE 0 0 NMOS_TEST W=2e-6 L=0.5e-6

.OP
.PRINT DC I(V1) V(DRAIN) V(GATE)
.END
